## Assign Owner

Writes Record Owner (owner, team, since, how, previousOwner) on ANY card carrying an `ownership` field; a card without one is refused by name. A card that also declares an `owner` link gets it set in the same save. Round-robin takes a CALLER-LOADED candidate pool (commands cannot search the realm) and cycles it; durable cross-session fairness would need a counter card — recorded as a known limit.

```ts
import AssignOwnerCommand from '@cardstack/catalog/cards/service-desk/commands/assign-owner-command';

await new AssignOwnerCommand(commandContext).execute({
  card: kase,
  owner: danaKim,
  teamName: 'Payments',
  strategy: 'assigned',
});
```

### Non-goals

No auto-selection of owners, no org lookup — who is eligible is the caller's knowledge.
